msgid "Master"
msgstr "Eyinhloko"

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Compare loss and latency with the SmokePing graphs and maintenance state. Escalate missing files, imports and relinking to an administrator."
msgstr "Qhathanisa ukulahleka nokubambezeleka namagrafu e-SmokePing nesimo sokulungiswa. Dlulisela amafayela angekho, okungenisiwe kanye nokuxhunywa kabusha kumlawuli."

