msgid "skipped, %s"
msgstr "kweqiwe, %s"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "XML"
msgstr "XML"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "YAML (default)"
msgstr "YAML (okuzenzakalelayo)"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Ukucushwa kwe-SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot export or import the SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "Izimvume zakho zedivayisi azihlanganisi yonke idivayisi, ngakho awukwazi ukukhipha noma ukungenisa ukucushwa kwe-SmokePing. Cela umlawuli onokufinyelela kuwo wonke amadivayisi."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Export the SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Khipha Ukucushwa kwe-SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The export holds the plugin settings, the SmokePing targets the plugin has read, and which device each is mapped to, by the device's host name and description. It holds no data source, graph, RRD file, or credential."
msgstr "Okukhishiwe kuqukethe izilungiselelo ze-plugin, okuhlosiwe kwe-SmokePing okufundwe yi-plugin, kanye nokuthi iyiphi idivayisi ngayinye eyabelwe kuyo, ngegama le-host nedivayisi nencazelo yayo. Akuqukethe mthombo wedatha, igrafu, ifayela le-RRD, noma imininingwane yokungena."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Landa"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Import a SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Ngenisa Ukucushwa kwe-SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Choosing a file only checks it. The next screen lists every change the file would make, and nothing is written until you confirm that list. An import adds and updates; it never deletes a target or moves a mapping, and it never creates an RRD file or touches the SmokePing data directory."
msgstr "Ukukhetha ifayela kulihlola kuphela. Isikrini esilandelayo sibala zonke izinhlelo zokushintsha ifayela elingazenza, futhi akukho okubhalwayo uze uqinisekise lolo hlu. Ukungenisa kuyangeza futhi kubuyekeze; akusoze kwasusa okuhlosiwe noma kwathutha ukwabiwa, futhi akusoze kwakha ifayela le-RRD noma kwathinta uhla lwemibhalo lwedatha ye-SmokePing."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Check File"
msgstr "Hlola Ifayela"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Import Check"
msgstr "Ukuhlolwa Kokungenisa"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Nothing was written."
msgstr "Akukho okubhaliwe."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_import.php
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Emuva"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The file cannot be imported until these errors are fixed. Nothing was written."
msgstr "Ifayela alikwazi ukungeniswa kuze kulungiswe la maphutha. Akukho okubhaliwe."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The installation already matches the file. There is nothing to import."
msgstr "Ukufakwa sekuhambisana nefayela. Akukho okungeniswayo."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Plan %s. Applying makes exactly these changes in one transaction. If the file or the installation changed since this check, the import is refused and you check again."
msgstr "Uhlelo %s. Ukusebenzisa kwenza lezi zinguquko ngqo emsebenzini owodwa. Uma ifayela noma ukufakwa kushintshile kusukela kulokhu kuhlolwa, ukungenisa kuyaliwa bese uhlola futhi."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Apply Import"
msgstr "Sebenzisa Ukungenisa"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Khansela"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Add SmokePing Targets"
msgstr "Engeza Okuhlosiwe kwe-SmokePing"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "no matching SmokePing target"
msgstr "akukho okuhlosiwe kwe-SmokePing okuhambisanayo"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Click Continue to add the SmokePing targets whose host is the host name of each selected device. Each target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Devices are never created here."
msgstr "Chofoza u-Qhubeka ukuze ungeze okuhlosiwe kwe-SmokePing okune-host eyigama le-host yedivayisi ngayinye ekhethiwe. Okuhlosiwe ngakunye kuthola igrafu yesifinyezo yezexwayiso futhi, uma idatha ye-SmokePing ingakwazi ukudwetshwa egrafini, igrafu ye-smoke. Amadivayisi awakhiwa lapha nakanye."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets match."
msgstr "%d okuhlosiwe kuyahambisana."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d objects created or mapped, %d skipped."
msgstr "Izinto ezingu-%d zakhiwe noma zabiwe, ezingu-%d zeqiwe."

#: lib/DeviceSaveCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "This device has SmokePing targets, but the reader that fills their summary values runs on poller %d and the device is saved on poller %d. Summary values and alerts stop until the device is assigned to poller %d again."
msgstr "Le divayisi inokuhlosiwe kwe-SmokePing, kodwa umfundi ogcwalisa amanani ayo esifinyezo usebenza ku-poller %d futhi idivayisi igcinwe ku-poller %d. Amanani esifinyezo nezexwayiso kuyama kuze kube idivayisi yabelwa ku-poller %d futhi."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "SmokePing Targets of this Device"
msgstr "Okuhlosiwe kwe-SmokePing kwale Divayisi"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs still draw the other colors; the main poller moves up to 200 per cycle."
msgstr "Amagrafu e-smoke angu-%d asadweba eminye imibala; i-poller eyinhloko ihambisa kufika ku-200 ngomjikelezo ngamunye."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs could not be moved; run upgrade-graphs to try them again, and see the Cacti log for the cause."
msgstr "Amagrafu e-smoke angu-%d awazange akwazi ukuthuthwa; sebenzisa i-upgrade-graphs ukuze uwazame futhi, bese ubheka ilogi ye-Cacti ukuthola imbangela."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting asks for SmokePing %s loss colors, but the reader found SmokePing %s. Set it to Automatic unless the graphs should differ from SmokePing's."
msgstr "Isilungiselelo se-Loss Colors sicela imibala yokulahleka ye-SmokePing %s, kodwa umfundi uthole i-SmokePing %s. Yisethe ku-Automatic ngaphandle uma amagrafu kufanele ahluke kweye-SmokePing."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting selects SmokePing %s loss colors for smoke graphs."
msgstr "Isilungiselelo se-Loss Colors sikhetha imibala yokulahleka ye-SmokePing %s yamagrafu e-smoke."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader found no SmokePing version, so the Loss Colors setting selects the loss colors of SmokePing 2.8 and later. If SmokePing is 2.7, set Loss Colors to SmokePing 2.7."
msgstr "Umfundi akatholanga nguqulo ye-SmokePing, ngakho isilungiselelo se-Loss Colors sikhetha imibala yokulahleka ye-SmokePing 2.8 nangaphezulu. Uma i-SmokePing iyi-2.7, setha i-Loss Colors ibe yi-SmokePing 2.7."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader found SmokePing %s, so the Loss Colors setting selects its loss colors."
msgstr "Umfundi uthole i-SmokePing %s, ngakho isilungiselelo se-Loss Colors sikhetha imibala yayo yokulahleka."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Thold is not installed, so no target alerts in both SmokePing and Thold."
msgstr "I-Thold ayifakiwe, ngakho akukho okuhlosiwe okuxwayisa kukho kokubili ku-SmokePing naku-Thold."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No target has both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold."
msgstr "Akukho okuhlosiwe okunesexwayiso se-SmokePing kanye nomkhawulo we-Thold ovuliwe kokubili."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets have both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold, so one problem may notify twice. Compare their alert conditions before removing either: %s"
msgstr "Okuhlosiwe okungu-%d kunesexwayiso se-SmokePing kanye nomkhawulo we-Thold ovuliwe kokubili, ngakho inkinga eyodwa ingazisa kabili. Qhathanisa izimo zazo zezexwayiso ngaphambi kokususa noma yikuphi: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import and are not retried automatically: %s Use Retry Template Import after fixing the cause."
msgstr "Izifanekiso ze-SmokePing zehlulekile ukungeniswa futhi azizanywa futhi ngokuzenzakalelayo: %s Sebenzisa u-Zama Futhi Ukungenisa Isifanekiso ngemva kokulungisa imbangela."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are not imported. Use Retry Template Import."
msgstr "Izifanekiso ze-SmokePing azingenisiwe. Sebenzisa u-Zama Futhi Ukungenisa Isifanekiso."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php smokeping_health.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are imported."
msgstr "Izifanekiso ze-SmokePing zingenisiwe."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Every device with summary data sources is polled by the reader's poller."
msgstr "Yonke idivayisi enemithombo yedatha yesifinyezo ihlolwa yi-poller yomfundi."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d devices have summary data sources but are not polled by poller %d, which runs the reader, so their summary values and alerts have no data: %s"
msgstr "Amadivayisi angu-%d anemithombo yedatha yesifinyezo kodwa awahlolwa yi-poller %d, esebenzisa umfundi, ngakho amanani awo esifinyezo nezexwayiso azinayo idatha: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration is read on poller %d, not on this server; the inventory row shows the result of its last read."
msgstr "Ukucushwa kwe-SmokePing kufundwa ku-poller %d, hhayi kulesi siphakeli; umugqa wohlu ubonisa umphumela wokufunda kwayo kokugcina."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s cannot be read: %s"
msgstr "Ukucushwa kwe-SmokePing %s akukwazi ukufundwa: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets; %d entries are skipped: %s"
msgstr "Ukucushwa kwe-SmokePing %s kubala okuhlosiwe okungu-%d; okufakiwe okungu-%d kweqiwe: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets."
msgstr "Ukucushwa kwe-SmokePing %s kubala okuhlosiwe okungu-%d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The PHP binary path setting is empty or not an executable file, so the reader cannot start."
msgstr "Isilungiselelo sendlela yebhinari ye-PHP asinalutho noma asilona ifayela elisebenzisekayo, ngakho umfundi akakwazi ukuqala."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader starts with %s."
msgstr "Umfundi uqala nge-%s."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader has not completed a run on this poller."
msgstr "Umfundi akakaqedi ukusebenza kule poller."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last reader run finished %d seconds ago, more than three poller intervals."
msgstr "Ukusebenza kokugcina komfundi kuphele emizuzwaneni engu-%d edlule, okungaphezu kwezikhawu ezintathu ze-poller."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds and has exceeded its time budget %d times."
msgstr "Umfundi ufunde uchungechunge olungu-%d kwezingu-%d ngemizuzwana engu-%.1f futhi weqe isabelo sawo sesikhathi izikhathi ezingu-%d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds, %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Umfundi ufunde uchungechunge olungu-%d kwezingu-%d ngemizuzwana engu-%.1f, emizuzwaneni engu-%d edlule."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No inventory has been read on this poller."
msgstr "Akukho uhlu olufundiwe kule poller."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last inventory failed %d seconds ago and the previous one is still in use: %s"
msgstr "Uhlu lokugcina luhlulekile emizuzwaneni engu-%d edlule futhi olwangaphambilini lusasetshenziswa: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The inventory listed %d targets %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Uhlu lubale okuhlosiwe okungu-%d emizuzwaneni engu-%d edlule."

