msgid "Import SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Ngenisa Ukucushwa kwe-SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Ukulungiselelwa"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The configured SmokePing file is read with the files it includes, from its own directory. An uploaded file is read on its own: @include is not allowed in it."
msgstr "Ifayela le-SmokePing elicushiwe lifundwa namafayela eliwafakayo, kusukela ohlwini lwalo lwemibhalo. Ifayela elilayishiwe lifundwa lodwa: i-@include ayivunyelwe kulo."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "The configured file, %s"
msgstr "Ifayela elicushiwe, %s"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "An uploaded file, without @include"
msgstr "Ifayela elilayishiwe, ngaphandle kwe-@include"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Uploaded File"
msgstr "Ifayela Elilayishiwe"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for an uploaded file: a SmokePing configuration of at most 4 MiB."
msgstr "Okwefayela elilayishiwe kuphela: ukucushwa kwe-SmokePing okungabi ngaphezu kuka-4 MiB."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Amadivayisi"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host groups targets that probe the same host. A device that already has the host name on the chosen poller is used instead of a new one."
msgstr "Idivayisi eyodwa nge-host ngayinye ye-SmokePing ihlanganisa okuhlosiwe okuhlola i-host efanayo. Idivayisi esivele inegama le-host ku-poller ekhethiwe iyasetshenziswa esikhundleni sentsha."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host"
msgstr "Idivayisi eyodwa nge-host ye-SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing target"
msgstr "Idivayisi eyodwa ngokuhlosiwe kwe-SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Device Template"
msgstr "Isifanekiso Sedivayisi"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The template of devices the import creates."
msgstr "Isifanekiso samadivayisi akhiwa ukungenisa."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "I-Poller"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The poller of new devices. It must be the poller that runs the SmokePing reader, or their summary data sources get no data."
msgstr "I-poller yamadivayisi amasha. Kufanele kube yi-poller esebenzisa umfundi we-SmokePing, noma imithombo yawo yedatha yesifinyezo ngeke ithole datha."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Site"
msgstr "Isayithi"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The site of new devices."
msgstr "Isayithi lamadivayisi amasha."

#: lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_inventory.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Lutho"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Graph Tree"
msgstr "Isihlahla Samagrafu"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Mirror the SmokePing hierarchy into a graph tree: each section becomes a branch, and each device a host under the branch of its targets. Existing branches and hosts are reused."
msgstr "Bonisa isigaba se-SmokePing esihlahleni samagrafu: isigaba ngasinye siba yigatsha, futhi idivayisi ngayinye iba yi-host ngaphansi kwegatsha lokuhlosiwe kwayo. Amagatsha nama-host akhona ayaphinda asetshenziswe."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "A new tree, named below"
msgstr "Isihlahla esisha, esiqanjwe ngezansi"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Do not mirror"
msgstr "Ungalingisi"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "New Tree Name"
msgstr "Igama Lesihlahla Esisha"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for a new tree. A tree that already has this name is used."
msgstr "Okwesihlahla esisha kuphela. Isihlahla esivele sinaleli gama siyasetshenziswa."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Preview reads the configuration and lists what the import would create. Nothing is written until you confirm that list on the next screen, and SmokePing's own files are never written."
msgstr "Ukubuka kuqala kufunda ukucushwa futhi kubala lokho ukungenisa okungakwakha. Akukho okubhalwayo uze uqinisekise lolo hlu esikrinini esilandelayo, futhi amafayela e-SmokePing uqobo awakaze abhalwe."

