msgid "Plan %s. Importing creates exactly what is listed above through Cacti's device, graph, and tree functions. If the SmokePing configuration or Cacti changed since this preview, the import is refused and you preview again."
msgstr "Uhlelo %s. Ukungenisa kwakha ngqo lokho okubalwe ngenhla ngemisebenzi yedivayisi, yegrafu, neyesihlahla ye-Cacti. Uma ukucushwa kwe-SmokePing noma i-Cacti kushintshile kusukela kulokhu kubuka kuqala, ukungenisa kuyaliwa bese ubuka kuqala futhi."

