#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Source"
msgstr "Umthombo we-SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Poller"
msgstr "I-Poller ye-SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The Cacti poller that runs on, or shares a filesystem with, the SmokePing host. Only this poller reads SmokePing data."
msgstr "I-poller ye-Cacti esebenza ku-, noma eyabelana ngesistimu yamafayela ne-, host ye-SmokePing. Yile poller kuphela efunda idatha ye-SmokePing."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration File"
msgstr "Ifayela Lokumisa le-SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The main SmokePing configuration file, read by the poller that runs the reader. The plugin reads it and the files it includes with its own parser and never writes to them. Includes must stay inside this file's directory."
msgstr "Ifayela eliyinhloko lokumisa le-SmokePing, elifundwa yi-poller esebenzisa umfundi. I-plugin ilifunda kanye namafayela eliwafakayo nge-parser yayo futhi ayikaze ibhale kuwo. Okufakiwe kumele kuhlale ngaphakathi kohla lwemibhalo lwaleli fayela."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Data Directory"
msgstr "Uhla Lwemibhalo Lwedatha ye-SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The datadir from SmokePing's configuration, as SmokePing sees it."
msgstr "I-datadir evela ekumiseni kwe-SmokePing, njengoba i-SmokePing iyibona."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Cacti Mount of the Data Directory"
msgstr "I-Mount ye-Cacti Yohla Lwemibhalo Lwedatha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "A read-only bind or NFS mount of the SmokePing data directory inside the Cacti RRA path. Cacti only reads RRD files inside its RRA path and never through a symlink."
msgstr "I-bind mount yokufunda kuphela noma i-NFS mount yohla lwemibhalo lwedatha ye-SmokePing ngaphakathi kwendlela ye-RRA ye-Cacti. I-Cacti ifunda amafayela e-RRD kuphela ngaphakathi kwendlela yayo ye-RRA futhi ayikaze iwafunde nge-symlink."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Isifundi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Isabelomali Sesikhathi Sesifundi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend reading RRD files before it stops and resumes on the next poller cycle."
msgstr "Amasekhondi ukusebenza okukodwa komfundi okungawachitha kufunda amafayela e-RRD ngaphambi kokuba kume bese kuqhubeka kumjikelezo olandelayo we-poller."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Inventory Interval"
msgstr "Isikhawu Sohlu Lwempahla"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Minimum seconds between inventory runs. The inventory also runs when the configuration file changes."
msgstr "Amasekhondi amancane phakathi kokusebenza kohlu lwempahla. Uhlu lwempahla luyasebenza futhi uma ifayela lokumisa lishintsha."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness Allowance"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Wobusha Bedatha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds past one step for which a measurement still counts as current."
msgstr "Amasekhondi ngale kwesinyathelo esisodwa lapho isilinganiso sisabalwa njengesamanje."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Loss Colors"
msgstr "Imibala Yokulahlekelwa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Which SmokePing loss colors the smoke graphs draw. SmokePing 2.7 draws other loss levels than 2.8 and later. Automatic follows the SmokePing version the reader finds next to SmokePing, shown on the health page, and uses 2.8 and later when it finds none."
msgstr "Imiphi imibala yokulahlekelwa ye-SmokePing edwetshwa amagrafu e-smoke. I-SmokePing 2.7 idweba amazinga okulahlekelwa ahlukile kunayi-2.8 nakamuva. Okuzenzakalelayo kulandela inguqulo ye-SmokePing etholwa ngumfundi eduze kwe-SmokePing, eboniswa ekhasini lezempilo, futhi kusebenzisa i-2.8 nakamuva uma kungatholi lutho."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Okuzenzakalelayo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing 2.8 and later"
msgstr "I-SmokePing 2.8 nakamuva"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing 2.7"
msgstr "I-SmokePing 2.7"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khipha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina Amathebula E-plugin Uma Ukhipha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its inventory, mapping, and health tables. SmokePing files are never removed either way."
msgstr "Uma kumakiwe, ukukhipha i-plugin kugcina amathebula ayo ohlu lwempahla, okuhlela, kanye nezempilo. Amafayela e-SmokePing awasuswa nanoma yikuphi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Backup Directory"
msgstr "Uhla Lwemibhalo Lwesipele"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Where the uninstall writes its export of the plugin configuration. Leave blank to use the cache/smokeping directory of Cacti, which the plugin protects with a deny-all rule. A directory set here must already exist, be writable, and be outside the web root; when it is not writable no export is written."
msgstr "Lapho ukukhipha kubhala khona ukuthunyelwa kokumisa kwe-plugin. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze usebenzise uhla lwemibhalo lwe-cache/smokeping lwe-Cacti, i-plugin eluvikela ngomthetho we-deny-all. Uhla lwemibhalo olusethwe lapha kumele seluvele lukhona, lubhaleke, futhi lube ngaphandle kwe-web root; uma lungabhaleki akukho okuthunyelwayo okubhalwayo."

